  "limitations": "Missing calendar dates are not filled as zero sales; stale or insufficient history returns insufficient_evidence. Future records are excluded. Forecasts are level baselines; weekday aggregates are descriptive, not a fitted seasonal model. Intervals use residual RMSE and sqrt(horizon), are not calibrated, and remain null without evaluation residuals. No promotion covariates, Bayesian posterior, forecast accuracy claim or production connector.",
